{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102360","id":2312643915,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6J2CVL","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102360","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102360.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102360.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102360","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102360/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102360/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102360/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/b9bebf708197e17ea94b7fc91f5251e082f6235f","number":102360,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Implement seek operation for Theora video files, improve multi-channel audio resampling.","user":{"login":"berarma","id":162766,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2Mjc2Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/162766?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma","html_url":"https://github.com/berarma","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"I've implemented the `set_stream_position` operation for Theora video files and as a consequence also `get_length`. It also tries to comply with the documentation by not changing the current frame when `stop` is called and playing seamless loops.\r\n\r\nI've made a [simple videoplayer project](/berarma/godot-videoplayer) to help test video playing on Godot.\r\n\r\n- *Production edit: This closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/10148.\r\nSee also https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/14430\r\nand https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/57744.*\r\n\r\nUPDATE: I've done more testing and added a few more improvements/fixes:\r\n\r\n- Fix crackling sound when playing videos with 6 channels.\r\n- Add 8-channel audio support. (See https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/37536#issuecomment-2053667996)\r\n- Add stereo down-mixing when playing files with 4/6/8 channels.  (See https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/37536#issuecomment-2053667996)\r\n- Use a permanent audio buffer to avoid copying the same buffer again and again when the output buffer is full.\r\n- Dynamic audio buffer size adapted to the number of channels, up to 8K samples,.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":572781997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw1NzI3ODE5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:audio","name":"topic:audio","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://gith